<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="container mt-5 mb-5">

    <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9">

      <h1 class="text-center mb-4">About Me</h1>

      <article>
        <h3>My Background</h3>

        <p>
          I'm currently a second-year student at
          Ontario Tech University studying Networking
          and IT Security. I chose this program because
          I've always been interested in computers
          and wanted to learn more about networks.
        </p>

        <p>
          So far, I've taken courses in networking,
          programming, and computer security.
          I've worked on different school assignments
          that helped me understand these topics
          better through practice.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mt-4">
        <h3>My Interests</h3>

        <p>
          Outside of school, I like working on personal
          technology projects. I've been learning more
          about web development and have worked on
          a few websites of my own.
        </p>

        <p>
          I'm mainly interested in cybersecurity and
          would like to work in that field after
          graduating. I'm still learning about the
          different areas of IT and figuring out
          which ones interest me the most.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
    </div>

    </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
